			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4794188">
									

<p>This is a pretty decent setup for a story, but you need to go a bit further. &quot;A bathroom that has never been connected to the waterline&quot; makes me go 'hm', but the next natural question that will arise is &quot;why?&quot;.</p>
<p>So, why? To what end does this exist? Who made it? Was it made? At the moment, this is all hook, no payoff. Think of an interesting endpoint for this. As much as I like public infrastructure and civil engineering, I'm not here to read about two researchers analysing water samples for 2 thousand words.</p>

